   "answer": "Unit regression tests only the changed area. Regional regression tests the changed area plus the modules it affects, found through impact analysis with developers. Full regression tests the whole product. Choose by the size and risk of the change and the time available, for example regional regression for a small fix and full regression before a major release.",
   "explain": "<p>Impact analysis is the key skill: ask developers what code was touched, check shared components and the RTM, and look at past defect clusters.</p>"
